'''Las Alemáns''' ([[Baliscano language|Baliscano]] and [[Catalan language|Catalan]] meaning "the {{W|Germans}}") is a highly urbanized [[communes of Balisca|commune]] in the [[Cerdanya]]n [[regions of Balisca|region]] of [[Antüko]]. The city recorded population of 303,492 in the [[2025 Baliscan census]].

The city has a multicultural and multilingual heritage, being so strongly influenced by a mixture of 18th–century Catalan, Occitan, and German-speaking [[W:Prussia|Prussian]] and [[W:Austrian Empire|Austrian]] immigrants, and long-existent Indigenous cultures that they are considered to be especially exceptional in Balisca. 

